WEBVTT

00:04:27.747 --> 00:04:32.859
So I think we ought
to celebrate that fact.

00:04:32.883 --> 00:04:36.789
And it comes out of talking circles
as you point out,

00:04:36.813 --> 00:04:39.377
which used to be called
consciousness raising groups.

00:04:39.401 --> 00:04:42.892
And it just means
that you sit in a circle,

00:04:42.916 --> 00:04:46.329
as Native Americans taught us long ago,

00:04:46.353 --> 00:04:50.516
and you each get to speak in turn --

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:54.262
Native Americans passed
around a talking stick --

00:04:54.286 --> 00:04:57.889
and everybody has to listen
while each person --

00:04:57.913 --> 00:05:01.726
and in that way, you say unsayable things